Altivar ATV21HD15M3X
====================

Setup

TYP 3 Factory reset
TYP 1 Factory reset 50 Hz

Followed quick setup instructions:

AUF:
 * Pt 1 (Variable torque) - Motor control mode
 * uL 50.0 Hz - Motor rated frequency
 * uLu  200 V - Motor rated Voltage
F415: 54 A - Motor rated full load current
F417: 6000 RPM - Motor rated speed
F601: 67.1 % - Motor Current Limit
F400: 2 (Auto Tuning)
AUF:
 * AU1 1 (Enabled) - Auto ramp adaptation
 * ACC 10 s - Acceleration time 1
 * dEC 10 s - Deceleration time 1
 * LL 0.0 Hz - Low speed
 * Ul 50.0 Hz - High Speed (UL?)
 * tHr ca. 64% - Motor rated current overload setting (not sure about this one.
F300: untouched.
CNOD: 0 (control terminal logic input)

F109: 2 (Logic input - source positive logic)
F111: 2 (forward run command)
F112: 3 (reverse run command)
F113: 10 (fault reset)

FNOd: 2 (VIB) - Remote Mode Primary Speed Reference Source

Fr: 2 (Run FORWARD with reverse selectable) - had no effect
F311: Was 1 (Reverse operation PROHIBITED), changed to 0 (Forward and
      Reverse operation PERMITTED)


Old Altivar 71 settings
=======================
tCC 2/3 wire control = 2C
CFG Macro configuration = HDG (M. handling)
CCFG Customized macro = yes
bFr Standard mot. freq  = 50
iPl Input phase loss = No
nPr Rated motor Power = 4.5
*unS Rated motor volt = 100
nCr Rated motor current = 20.5
*FrS Rated motor frequency = 200
nSP Rated motor speed = 6000
*tFr max frequency = 200
tun Auto tuning = No
TuS Auto tuning status = tab (Not Done)
PHr Output Ph rotation ACB (Reverse)
iTH Mot. term. current = 11.3
*ACC Acceleration = 1.5
*Dec Deceleration = 1.5
*LSB Low Speed = 0.0
*HSP High Speed = 200



AUF:
 * Pt 0 (Constant V/Hz) - Motor control mode
  - low torque with 1 but error out with EPH0 (1 = Variable torque)
  - higher torque, but error out with EPH0 (2 = Constant V/Hz with automatic torque boost)
  - error out with eph0 (0 Constant V/Hz with automatic torque boost) - Motor control mode
 * uL 200.0 Hz - Motor rated frequency
   - testing uL 50 Hz gave very eratic behaviour
 * uLu  200 V - Motor rated Voltage
 * ACC 3 s - Acceleration time 1 (first 1.5)
 * dEC 3 s - Deceleration time 1 (first 1.5)
 * Ul 200.0 Hz - High Speed
 * tHr ca. 64% - Motor rated current overload setting (not sure about this one.
FH: 200 Hz

F213: 200 Hz (VIB output frequency level 2)
 - var 50 Hz

